0..79 Comment "//! A presented type whose constructor holds a continuation. A field written `A"
80..149 Comment "//! => T` is the description code\'s function former, the higher-order"
150..197 Comment "//! descriptions\' `Π` over a type of arguments"
198..275 Comment "//! [Chapman-2010-gentle_art_levitation]. It decodes to the thunked arrow the"
276..353 Comment "//! native reading gives the same field, so the type keeps its rule. Programs"
354..432 Comment "//! that read and store a state are state\'s free model, and put-put is the law"
433..512 Comment "//! of state a store obeys [Plotkin-2002-notions_computation_determine_monads]."
